# DIT-OS agent rules

`AGENTS.md` at the repository root is the source of truth; skills live in
`.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. In particular:

- Keep `handoff.md` current during multi-step work; read it first if it
  exists (`.agents/skills/handoff/SKILL.md`).
- Every change: clean build, `scripts/qemu-test.sh`, `scripts/cppcheck.sh`,
  and a written security audit with the known-CVE pass
  (`.agents/skills/security-audit/SKILL.md`).
- Before discarding changes, check `git status` and limit the command to the
  files you changed yourself.
